    "prompt": "Simplify\n$$\\dfrac{\\tan(90^\\circ-\\theta)+\\cot(90^\\circ-\\theta)}{\\tan(90^\\circ+\\theta)-\\cot(90^\\circ+\\theta)}.$$",
